ty-pi-2 : (Γ : CCtx) (m : Word) (cA cB : Code) → m ≡ #2 → (a : TyShape) (TA : Mean Γ (Sem a)) → Der (j-ty , Γ , a , cA , TA) →
  (b : TyShape) (TB : Mean (ext-h Γ a (Sem a) (λ y → y) TA) (Sem b)) → Der (j-ty , ext-h Γ a (Sem a) (λ y → y) TA , b , cB , TB) →
  Dec1 (Out Γ (cpi m cA cB) m-ty)
ty-pi-2 Γ m cA cB pm a TA dA b TB dB =
  c-derived (s-fam f-pi a b , fam-of Γ a b TA TB ,
    der-code j-ty Γ (s-fam f-pi a b) (cpi #2 cA cB) (cpi m cA cB) (fam-of Γ a b TA TB) (λ i → cpi (pm (~ i)) cA cB)
      (dty-fam f-pi Γ a b (fam-of Γ a b TA TB) cA cB (fam-dA Γ a b TA TB cA dA) (fam-dB Γ a b TA TB cB dB)))
